{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果已將其美國在線教育商店中 MacBook Neo 的起售價從 599 美元上調至 649 美元。這意味着大學生及其他符合資格的人羣購買這款筆記本時，所能享受的優惠已縮水至 50 美元，此前為 100 美元。報道稱，這一調整發生在過去一周內，其他國家和地區的相應價格也按當地貨幣同步上調。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584212.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T18:20:52.117127+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T18:05:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T18:18:08.853740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T18:18:08.853740+00:00","content_hash":"69579338efe1d203a1af0d34d291513a1a29b75e729ba60c3d609124e975d7b5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}